grainsmith — NOTICE
===================

grainsmith is distributed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

This package bundles the static frontend assets of the interactive UI
"grainsmith studio", which is not enabled in this release. The studio's
frontend is a React single-page application whose pre-built static bundle
ships inside the wheel under `grainsmith/ui/static/`.
That bundle embeds third-party software and fonts; their full license texts are
reproduced in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.

